            "title": "Bio",
            "text": "<p>After 30 years as a police officer, having spent most of my life helping people and pursuing my own fitness through triathlon, cycling, running, and, more recently, hybrid training such as Hyrox, Deka, and Deadly Dozen, I wanted to give back by helping others improve their fitness.<br/><br/></p>",
