            "image": "shopify://shop_images/484304173.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Having attended commercial gyms, where it can intimidating for people who don't know how to train, use the equipment, or are body conscious, at Lifesportfitness, this isn't the case, everyone works together in an inclusive location. <br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
